{"ref":"BDB, אִתַּי","hw":"אִתַּי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אִתַּי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>perhaps from <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵת</span> <em>with</em> = <em>companionable</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  one of David’s captains, a native of Gath <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.19\">2 S 15:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.22\">22</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.2\">18:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.12\">12</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  one of David’s 30 mighty men, a Benjamite <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:29\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.29\">2 S 23:29</a> (in <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.31\">1 Ch 11:31</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אִתַי</span> var. <span dir=\"rtl\">אִיתַי</span>).","next":"BDB, אִיתִיאֵל","prev":"BDB, אֶתְבַּ֫עַל"}